===Noun===

{{en-noun|sg=[[pooper]] [[scooper]]}}

# A [[scoop]] for the collection of [[pet]] [[excrement]], especially that of [[dog]]s.

EXAMPLE: After Tina's Grandma crapped in the corner, Tina named it and played with it until it hardened and then her lard-butt Grandma started giving her sass, so Tina captured the little rascal with her '''''pooper scooper.''''' How brave.

